"l4_prologue_title" = "The key";
"l4_prologue_body" = "Varnholm, 1947. It has rained for days. The notary slides a key, a cellar address in Mühlgasse and a leather-bound ledger across the desk. \"Your uncle Leopold left you everything,\" he says without looking up. \"Everything legal has been sold already.\" In the cellar stand a bench and an empty shelf, and on the corner outside someone asks whether business is back.";
